                                                "sense_id": "acdcef11-0c1c-3979-aa66-68d4a35585fc",
                                                "text": "... \"Baby's Eyes\" ... \"Mud-Pie Days\" ... \"Baby Hands\" ... \"Creep, Baby, Creep\" ... \"My Mamma Lives Up in the Sky\" ... \"My Mother's Kiss\" ... It was the diaperhood of the Alley — a Society for the Prevention of Cruelty to Children set to children's music."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac5880dd-dafe-4684-9721-c8fb192cd3d4",
                                                "sense_id": "acdcef11-0c1c-3979-aa66-68d4a35585fc",
                                                "text": "...all this despite the fact that I was born and raised in the same Peninsula and had been trout fishing avidly almost from diaperhood."
                                            },
                                            {
