                                                "sense_id": "acdcef11-0c1c-3979-aa66-68d4a35585fc",
                                                "text": "Of those teenagers who are insured and who continue to see a primary-care doctor, a vast majority remain with the pediatricians or family doctors who have cared for them since diaperhood."
